      "path": "src/i18n/zh_CN/wordQuery.json",
      "content": "The new `suggestions` key's zh_CN value (\"优化建议\") does not match its en_US counterpart (\"Suggestions\") nor the component that consumes it. `CodeTranslationPanel.vue` reads `i18n.suggestions || '备选'` (fallback meaning \"alternatives/candidates\"), whereas \"优化建议\" is the wording for `CodeExplainer` (which actually uses `suggestionsLabel`). Consider aligning the value with the translation panel's semantics (e.g. \"备选\") so the key is not misleading.",
