      "content": "The moved `.quick-action-btn` block still uses hardcoded `border-radius: 4px` and `line-height: 1.4`, while the rules it sits next to in this file (`.rag-toggle`, `.model-select`, `.reasoning-effort-select`) use the `$radius-sm` / `$line-height-normal` tokens. Since this block was relocated into a file that is otherwise tokenized, align it with the shared tokens for consistency.",
